[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:The Future]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.35]Does what Madam Bellinsky said come true? | 别林斯基夫人说的话应验了吗？
[00:14.66]At a village fair, I decided to visit a fortune-teller called Madam Bellinsky. | 在一个乡村集市上，我决定去拜访一位叫别林斯基夫人的算命人。
[00:22.34]I went into her tent and she told me to sit down. | 我走进她的帐篷，她叫我坐下。
[00:27.23]After I had given her some money, she looked into a crystal ball and said: | 我给了她一些钱后，她盯着一个水晶球说道：
[00:34.11]'A relation of yours is coming to see you. | “您的一个亲戚要来看您。
[00:38.29]She will be arriving this evening and intends to stay for a few days. | 她今晚到达，并打算住上几天。
[00:44.40]The moment you leave this tent, you will get a big surprise. | 您一走出这个帐篷，就会大吃一惊。
[00:49.83]A woman you know well will rush towards you. | 一位您很熟悉的女人将向您冲来。
[00:54.18]She will speak to you and then she will lead you away from this place. That is all.' | 她会对您说些什么，然后带您离开这个地方。就是这些。”
[01:02.40]As soon as I went outside, I forgot all about Madam Bellinsky because my wife hurried towards me. | 我一走出帐篷，就把别林斯基夫人忘得一干二净，因为我妻子急匆匆地朝我走来。
[01:11.48]'Where have you been hiding?' she asked impatiently. | “你躲到哪儿去了？”她不耐烦地问。
[01:16.83]'Your sister will be here in less than an hour and we must be at the station to meet her. We are late already.' | “你姐姐不到一个小时就要到了，我们必须去车站接她。我们已经迟了。”
[01:26.58]As she walked away, I followed her out of the fair. | 当她走开时，我便跟着她出了集市。
